- **Nothing half-finished:** there are no commits since round 6 (`f7a60c35`). The only uncommitted task changes are 6 `last_update` timestamp bumps, with no status changes. No new rulings have landed.
- **Same rankings:** I re-ran `fw bvp --include-proposed` and got the same scores as rounds 4–6.
- **No usable Q1 tasks:** the only high-value/low-cost tasks are T-863 and T-860, both parked at `later`, and T-702, which is yours.

**Why I stopped:** each Q2 and higher-scoring candidate is still blocked by one of 10 unanswered questions for you (§6 of the handback). The one that unblocks work fastest is whether to promote T-863. If yes:
`cd /opt/832-Workflow-designer && .agentic-framework/bin/fw task update T-863 --horizon now`

**Something odd about the run itself:** the round 8 and 9 prompt files have timestamps later than when this round started, and their output files are dated 02:18. If the orchestrator writes later prompts before the earlier rounds hand back, rounds 8 and 9 won't see this handback. I only looked at the timestamps and haven't dug further. Unless you answer some of the questions in §6 first, rounds 8 and 9 will almost certainly find the same board.

Two small notes: the handback file is under a gitignored path, so I added it with `git add -f`, which is presumably how earlier rounds' handbacks got in. The commit went through `fw git commit`, which didn't add the Co-Authored-By line, and I didn't amend it.
